data: {"event":"node_finished","conversation_id":"6fe3b254-57e5-479e-af03-4b38a06d4d50","message_id":"37f0167e-36e2-47f6-b4a6-23c9e98bde2f","created_at":1793277843,"task_id":"2918eae6-a5fd-4a33-851e-44c9ad463468","workflow_run_id":"b2eff484-6f64-4cbe-89e7-30e569e07a19","data":{"id":"f5c4c896-bb4c-4df7-9aea-430490df19a8","node_id":"1002","node_type":"parameter-extractor","title":"小二听音","index":2,"predecessor_node_id":null,"inputs":{"query":"掌柜的，还认得我吗？上次那碗断肠面，我可记得清清楚楚。","files":[],"parameters":[{"description":"行为类别，必须是请安、点菜、请客、吹牛、叙旧、打听、赊账、还账、捣乱、威胁、偷窃之一","name":"action","options":null,"required":true,"type":"string"},{"description":"用于检索江湖异闻的关键词，最多4个，空格分隔，没有填「无」","name":"keywords","options":null,"required":false,"type":"string"},{"description":"客人自报的名号，没有填「无」","name":"player_name","options":null,"required":false,"type":"string"}],"instruction":"你是「不二客栈」里跑堂的小二，只负责听客人的话并传话，不回答客人。\n从下面这句话里提取三样东西：\n1. action：客人的行为，只能从这些词里选一个：请安、点菜、请客、吹牛、叙旧、打听、赊账、还账、捣乱、威胁、偷窃。实在判断不了填「叙旧」。\n2. keywords：客人提到的人、物、地点、话题，最多 4 个，用空格分隔。没有就填「无」。\n3. player_name：客人自报的名号（如“我叫令狐冲”“叫我冲哥”），没有就填「无」。\n只做提取，不要回答问题，不要编造客人没说的内容。","model_provider":"langgenius/deepseek/deepseek","model_name":"deepseek-flash"},"inputs_truncated":false,"process_data":{"model_mode":"chat","prompts":[{"files":[],"role":"system","text":"You should always follow the instructions and output a valid JSON object.\nThe structure of the JSON object you can found in the instructions.\n\n### Memory\nHere are the chat histories between human and assistant, inside <histories></histories> XML tags.\n<histories>\n\n</histories>\n\n### Instructions:\nSome extra information are provided below, you should always follow the instructions as possible as I can.\n<instructions>\n你是「不二客栈」里跑堂的小二，只负责听客人的话并传话，不回答客人。\n从下面这句话里提取三样东西：\n1. action：客人的行为，只能从这些词里选一个：请安、点菜、请客、吹牛、叙旧、打听、赊账、还账、捣乱、威胁、偷窃。实在判断不了填「叙旧」。\n2. keywords：客人提到的人、物、地点、话题，最多 4 个，用空格分隔。没有就填「无」。\n3. player_name：客人自报的名号（如“我叫令狐冲”“叫我冲哥”），没有就填「无」。\n只做提取，不要回答问题，不要编造客人没说的内容。\n</instructions>"},{"files":[],"role":"user","text":"### Structure\nHere is the structure of the JSON object, you should always follow the structure.\n<structure>\n{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"location\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"The location to get the weather information\", \"required\": true}}, \"required\": [\"location\"]}\n</structure>\n\n### Text to be converted to JSON\nInside <text></text> XML tags, there is a text that you should convert to a JSON object.\n<text>\nWhat is the weather today in SF?\n</text>"},{"files":[],"role":"assistant","text":"{\"location\": \"San Francisco\"}"},{"files":[],"role":"user","text":"### Structure\nHere is the structure of the JSON object, you should always follow the structure.\n<structure>\n{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"food\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"The food to eat\", \"required\": true}}, \"required\": [\"food\"]}\n</structure>\n\n### Text to be converted to JSON\nInside <text></text> XML tags, there is a text that you should convert to a JSON object.\n<text>\nI want to eat some apple pie.\n</text>"},{"files":[],"role":"assistant","text":"{\"food\": \"apple pie\"}"},{"files":[],"role":"user","text":"### Structure\nHere is the structure of the JSON object, you should always follow the structure.\n<structure>\n{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"action\": {\"description\": \"\\u884c\\u4e3a\\u7c7b\\u522b\\uff0c\\u5fc5\\u987b\\u662f\\u8bf7\\u5b89\\u3001\\u70b9\\u83dc\\u3001\\u8bf7\\u5ba2\\u3001\\u5439\\u725b\\u3001\\u53d9\\u65e7\\u3001\\u6253\\u542c\\u3001\\u8d4a\\u8d26\\u3001\\u8fd8\\u8d26\\u3001\\u6363\\u4e71\\u3001\\u5a01\\u80c1\\u3001\\u5077\\u7a83\\u4e4b\\u4e00\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"keywords\": {\"description\": \"\\u7528\\u4e8e\\u68c0\\u7d22\\u6c5f\\u6e56\\u5f02\\u95fb\\u7684\\u5173\\u952e\\u8bcd\\uff0c\\u6700\\u591a4\\u4e2a\\uff0c\\u7a7a\\u683c\\u5206\\u9694\\uff0c\\u6ca1\\u6709\\u586b\\u300c\\u65e0\\u300d\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"player_name\": {\"description\": \"\\u5ba2\\u4eba\\u81ea\\u62a5\\u7684\\u540d\\u53f7\\uff0c\\u6ca1\\u6709\\u586b\\u300c\\u65e0\\u300d\", \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"action\"]}\n</structure>\n\n### Text to be converted to JSON\nInside <text></text> XML tags, there is a text that you should convert to a JSON object.\n<text>\n掌柜的，还认得我吗？上次那碗断肠面，我可记得清清楚楚。\n</text>"}],"usage":{"completion_price":"0","completion_price_unit":"0","completion_tokens":24,"completion_unit_price":"0","currency":"USD","latency":0.9878948590001073,"prompt_price":"0","prompt_price_unit":"0","prompt_tokens":941,"prompt_unit_price":"0","time_to_first_token":null,"time_to_generate":null,"total_price":"0","total_tokens":965},"function":{},"tool_call":null,"model_provider":"langgenius/deepseek/deepseek","model_name":"deepseek-flash","llm_text":"{\"action\": \"叙旧\", \"keywords\": \"掌柜 断肠面\", \"player_name\": \"无\"}"},"process_data_truncated":false,"outputs":{"__is_success":1,"__reason":null,"__usage":{"completion_price":"0","completion_price_unit":"0","completion_tokens":24,"completion_unit_price":"0","currency":"USD","latency":0.9878948590001073,"prompt_price":"0","prompt_price_unit":"0","prompt_tokens":941,"prompt_unit_price":"0","time_to_first_token":null,"time_to_generate":null,"total_price":"0","total_tokens":965},"action":"叙旧","keywords":"掌柜 断肠面","player_name":"无"},"outputs_truncated":false,"status":"succeeded","error":null,"elapsed_time":0.998705,"execution_metadata":{"total_tokens":965,"total_price":"0","currency":"USD"},"created_at":1793277842,"finished_at":1793277843,"files":[],"iteration_id":null,"loop_id":null}}

